{"id":"8317eefb4572709e","group":"58","path":"58/batch15/58-df-injective.md","title":"Injection","display":"df-injective — Injection","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-injective","aliases":["58-df-injective"],"display":"df-injective — Injection","depends_on":["[[58-df-function]]","[[58-df-set]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-injective"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-injective</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-injective — Injection"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"65d9a1e690c32aad\" href=\"?note=65d9a1e690c32aad\" title=\"58-df-set\">58-df-set</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\">\\(A,B\\)</span> (sets, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"65d9a1e690c32aad\" href=\"?note=65d9a1e690c32aad\" title=\"58-df-set\">58-df-set</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span> (function)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}(f,A,B)\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}(f,A,B)\\)</span> (函数谓词, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Injective}(f,A,B)\">\\(\\mathrm{Injective}(f,A,B)\\)</span> (单射谓词 defined here)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Injective}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Injective}_S\\)</span>（兼容调用谓词，其参数和定义式见下文）。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}injective} \\vdash \\mathrm{Injective}(f,A,B) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Function}(f,A,B) \\land \\forall x_1\\in A\\;\\forall x_2\\in A\\;(f(x_1)=f(x_2)\\to x_1=x_2)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}injective} \\vdash \\mathrm{Injective}(f,A,B) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Function}(f,A,B) \\land \\forall x_1\\in A\\;\\forall x_2\\in A\\;(f(x_1)=f(x_2)\\to x_1=x_2)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Injective}_S(f,A,B)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Injective}(f,A,B).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Injective}_S(f,A,B)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Injective}(f,A,B).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure>","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-set","status":"resolved","id":"65d9a1e690c32aad","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-set","status":"resolved","id":"65d9a1e690c32aad","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A,B$ (sets, see [[58-df-set]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Function}(f,A,B)$ (函数谓词, see [[58-df-function]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"t